TI  - YOLO11-FEM: Feature Enhancement and Multi-Scale Fusion for Accurate Rice Disease and Pest Detection in Complex Field Environments
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 International Conference on Image, Signal Processing and Pattern Recognition, ISPP 2026
SP  - 190
EP  - 194
DO  - 10.1109/ISPP69262.2026.11543037
